{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 64, :comments ["<b>But among these there was not a man, etc.</b> But against the women the decree of the spies was not decreed, because they cherished the Land — the men would say, 'Let us appoint a head and return to Egypt,' and the women would say, 'Give us an inheritance.' Therefore the section of the daughters of Tzelofechad was juxtaposed here (Tanchuma)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:57.501101085Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}